# Route: guide 42 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 22 quests, 1.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tanaris, Un'Goro Crater): Gadgetzan -> Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan
# -> Broken Pillar -> Gadgetzan -> Ironstone Plateau -> Lakkari Tar Pits ->
# Fire Plume Ridge -> The Marshlands -> Lakkari Tar Pits -> The Slithering
# Scar -> Fire Plume Ridge -> Lakkari Tar Pits -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll
# Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The
# Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788).

